@api = http://localhost:5000

### Server is running -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### Assignment list -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Assignment detail -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### Assignment does not exist -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### Non-integer route value -> 404 from routing, empty body
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/abc

### Create a submission -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### Read the created submission -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Invalid submission body -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Closed assignment -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### Duplicate submission -> 409 DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### Delete the created submission -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Deleted submission -> 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Missing Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV003",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv003/rest-api"
}

### Unsupported method -> 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### Malformed JSON -> 400 from the framework
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV004",
